WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.200
<v MASTER BOB>Requirements come and go.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:08.300
<v MASTER BOB>Architectures rise and fall.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.800
<v MASTER BOB>Release dates drift like leaves in the wind.

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:15.400
<v LORD LING>Excellent. We changed the architecture.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:18.600
<v LORD LING>Also the timeline. Also the feature scope.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.200
<v MASTER BOB>The roadmap is merely a roadmap.

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:31.500
<v MASTER BOB>Some requirements are worth keeping.
